function partnersBody(){return '<a id="demigod-partners-back" href="/">← Back to Demigod</a><h1>Demigod Partners</h1><p class="dg-p-sub">Refer hiring startups, candidates, or both. Earn when Demigod places talent. VCs use priority intros for referred candidates.</p><h2>Who this is for</h2><div class="dg-p-grid"><div class="dg-p-card"><strong>VC &amp; accelerator ops</strong><em>priority intros for referred candidates. No referral fees.</em></div><div class="dg-p-card"><strong>Fractional CFO / COO / HR</strong><em>Cash track — earn when a client you intro hires through Demigod.</em></div><div class="dg-p-card"><strong>Recruiters &amp; communities</strong><em>Earn per placement you source, without running the search.</em></div><div class="dg-p-card"><strong>Founders &amp; operators</strong><em>Refer candidates or hiring companies in your network.</em></div></div><h2>Compensation (cash referral track)</h2><p>Demigod charges startups <strong>10% of first-year salary</strong> only when they hire. Referral partners earn <strong>20% of our placement fee</strong> on each successful hire they sourced — startup intro <em>or</em> candidate intro.</p><table class="dg-p-table"><thead><tr><th>Salary</th><th>Demigod fee (10%)</th><th>Your referral (20% of fee)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>$150,000</td><td>$15,000</td><td><strong>$3,000</strong></td></tr><tr><td>$180,000</td><td>$18,000</td><td><strong>$3,600</strong></td></tr><tr><td>$220,000</td><td>$22,000</td><td><strong>$4,400</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><ul><li><strong>Payout timing:</strong> Net 30 after the candidate completes our 90-day guarantee window (aligned with replacement policy).</li><li><strong>Tracking:</strong> Unique partner code + CC <a href="mailto:hello@trydemigod.com">hello@trydemigod.com</a> on intro emails.</li><li><strong>Minimum payout:</strong> $500 per placement; no cap on referrals.</li><li><strong>priority intros for referred candidates.</li></ul><h2>How it works</h2><div class="dg-p-steps"><div class="dg-p-step"><strong>1 · APPLY</strong><p>Submit the partner form. We verify fit and send your tracking code.</p></div><div class="dg-p-step"><strong>2 · INTRO</strong><p>Warm-intro startups or candidates. Include your code so we attribute the relationship.</p></div><div class="dg-p-step"><strong>3 · EARN</strong><p>When a hire starts and clears 90 days, we invoice the startup and pay your referral share.</p></div></div><h2>What we need from you</h2><ul><li>Warm intros only — no resume blasting or scraped lists.</li><li>SF Bay Area startups and candidates (our current focus).</li><li>Honest context on fit — we decline bad matches to protect your reputation.</li></ul><div class="dg-p-cta"><a class="button on-inverse w-button" href="'+P+'" data-demigod-modal="partner" data-dg-partner-apply="1"><span class="button_label">'+COPY.partnerCta+'</span></a><a class="button w-button" href="mailto:hello@trydemigod.com?subject=Demigod%20Partner%20Intro">Email an intro</a></div><p style="text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;color:#8A8478;margin-top:1.5rem">Questions? <a href="mailto:hello@trydemigod.com" style="color:#c9a84c">hello@trydemigod.com</a></p><p style="text-align:center;font-size:.7rem;color:#a8a29e;margin-top:.5rem">Phone enables SMS follow-up (pending) start for partners too.</p>'}
